# Tier 7, and the four that the "src/<name>-*/" pattern above does not cover.
# Their tarballs come from forge tag URLs and unpack to a plain name -- the
# scripts ask unpack() for "foot", not "foot-1.27.0" -- so there is no version
# in the directory for a wildcard to match, and they sat untracked and
# unignored, one "git add ." away from being committed as vendored source.
src/tllist/
src/fcft/
src/foot/
src/wmenu/

src/pdaemon/pdaemon
src/musl-*/
